[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3782.309, "timestamp": "01:03:02", "text": "一件毛衣——送给了蒂什，蒂什"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3789.349, "timestamp": "01:03:09", "text": "收到玛丽的情人节礼物后非常惊喜和高兴，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3793.91, "timestamp": "01:03:13", "text": "他问玛丽：“是你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3798.549, "timestamp": "01:03:18", "text": "自己织的吗？”玛丽说：“是的，是我织的。”她想知道这件毛衣"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3801.43, "timestamp": "01:03:21", "text": "是小是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3803.43, "timestamp": "01:03:23", "text": "大，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3808.549, "timestamp": "01:03:28", "text": "嗯，哪里……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3820.87, "timestamp": "01:03:40", "text": "谢谢。”然后说了声谢谢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3825.829, "timestamp": "01:03:45", "text": "嗨。嗯，是的，这是翻译。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3828.39, "timestamp": "01:03:48", "text": "你需要吗？哦，对了，我又忘了一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3830.549, "timestamp": "01:03:50", "text": "。是的，我想要一件这样的。是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3833.349, "timestamp": "01:03:53", "text": "。是的，这很重要。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3834.95, "timestamp": "01:03:54", "text": "嗯，是"}]